{"ID":"20240118151215-rt3jom5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151215-rt3jom5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151215-rt3jom5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151215-hf93vxr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122114502-l1638hu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122114502-l1638hu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:180,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:180\u0026#125;","title":"136胡麻（胡麻子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240130162402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151215-hf93vxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151215-hf93vxr","updated":"20240122114442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主伤中虚羸，补五内，益气力，长肌肉，填髓脑，久服轻身不老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114445-n54954m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114445-n54954m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，昔从胡来故曰胡麻，今名脂麻，有黑白黄三种，其大者曰巨胜子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114447-r9md2hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114447-r9md2hb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114448-p98vqix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114448-p98vqix"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】胡麻主长肌肉，补虚羸，滋润五脏，利大小便，其油亦作解毒用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114450-dmxxkqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114450-dmxxkqx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】坚筋骨，明耳目，耐饥渴，疗金疮止痛，及伤寒温疟，大吐后虚热羸困。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114451-pnzg809","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114451-pnzg809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】补中养气，润养五脏，补肺气，止心惊，利大小肠，耐寒暑，逐风湿气，游风头风，治劳气，产后羸困，催生落胞，细研涂发令长，白蜜蒸饵止百病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114454-yg4303l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114454-yg4303l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【廷飞】炒食不生风病，风人久食则步履端正，语言不蹇。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114456-d51p5h9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114456-d51p5h9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】生嚼涂小儿头疮，煎汤浴恶疮；妇人阴疮大效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114458-md7iz2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114458-md7iz2p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114459-7qerroc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114459-7qerroc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】多用为服食，少以入药，便溏者禁之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114501-3wrvswc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114501-3wrvswc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】麻油因其油质，故主滑利，但性不热，故行缓，无辛，故气不走窜，故下大便也缓。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114501-yepl03s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114501-yepl03s"}},{"ID":"20240122114502-nguc33b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114502-nguc33b"}},{"ID":"20240122114502-l1638hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114502-l1638hu","updated":"20240130162402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一三六，这个胡麻呢，跟前面第八十七味，这个八十七味讲的是它的苗，这个胡麻在讲胡麻子，实际上是巨胜子，为什么两边都会出现，雷同的啊，因为我想一个是本国产的，就是有麻油的麻子，一个是外面进口的，结果他把两个都写在一起，一个进口进来的叫胡麻，本国产的呢，所以他两个，实际上它两个类似很雷同的东西。那诸位可以参考一下同时回头看看第八十七号，八十七味药，类似相同的东西。我刚刚讲过，上经实际上只有一百二十味，可是从那个孙星衍他们下来，弄到一百四十几味啊。"}]}]}